[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936448576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116255#issuecomment-3936448576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116255","id":3936448576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qoXBA","user":{"login":"linrin07","id":85438800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07","html_url":"https://github.com/linrin07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T18:29:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T18:29:52Z","body":"Set the VERTEX in vertex function could avoid this issue. But when added a material overlay, the bug will occur again.\n```\nshader_type spatial;\n\nuniform bool test_bool;\nvoid vertex() {\n\tif (test_bool) {\n\t\tVERTEX = VERTEX;\n\t}\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936448576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4378618130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116255#issuecomment-4378618130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116255","id":4378618130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBPxpEg","user":{"login":"linrin07","id":85438800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07","html_url":"https://github.com/linrin07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linrin07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T11:01:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T11:01:26Z","body":"AMD latest driver (26.3.1)  reproducible in Godot 3.6.2.stable (not reproducible in 4.6.1)\nUsing TANGENT in vertex function or NORMALMAP (or ANISOTROPY) in fragment function will also trigger this bug. (uv1_triplanar  or normal_enabled or anisotropy_enabled in SpatialMaterial)\nUsing discard can bypass this bug(distance_fade_mode in SpatialMaterial).\n```\nshader_type spatial;\nuniform bool t_bool;\n\nvoid vertex() {\n\tif (t_bool) {}\n\tTANGENT;\n}\nvoid fragment() {\n\tNORMALMAP;\n\tANISOTROPY;\n//\tif(false){discard;}\n}\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4378618130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4518247132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116255#issuecomment-4518247132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116255","id":4518247132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDU763A","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T11:28:02Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T11:28:02Z","body":"I've tried with the MRP and following the instructions but so far no joy on reproducing this (I don't have AMD GPU handy, any more reports on other hardware, or different driver versions would be helpful).\n\nLooking at the final translated shader might yield some ideas, it's possible we are not writing to some output, and relying on the drivers to zero, but it's just guesswork at this stage.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4518247132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5156505994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116255#issuecomment-5156505994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116255","id":5156505994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM1oJig","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T08:21:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T08:21:55Z","body":"Looking a bit more, `OpenGL` is usually supposed to zero it, but it can be driver dependent, sounds like you've got one that doesn't, and one that having a dependency on something unset leads to UB. So this is probably just undefined behaviour in the driver, and to be fair it's not being helped much here.\n\nSolution is presumably to set it.\n\nLooks like you may just be able to write:\n```\nuniform bool test_bool = false;\n```\nSee if that helps...\n\nOr actually set it in regular code (as is the intended way to use uniforms):\n```\nshader_mat.set_shader_param(\"test_bool\", true)\n```\nOn engine side we could presumably set all uniforms to zero manually to help with this kind of driver bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5156505994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]